{
  "title": "yeasty shattering syrian weeknight tagine",
  "description": "Deliciously flavorful and easy to make, this yeasty tagine is perfect for a quick weeknight dinner. Featuring lardons and blackberries, it's a tasty twist on traditional Syrian cuisine.",
