  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine flour, yeast, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the lardons and mix until just combined.",
    "Add the blackberries and mix until just combined.",
    "Gradually add the water while mixing until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5-7 minutes until smooth.",
    "Place the dough in the copper-mug and let it rise in a warm place for 1 hour, or until doubled in size.",
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Bake the tagine for 20-25 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Cool the tagine for 5 minutes before slicing and serving."
